      "message": "Step 4:\nAfter the selected code logic is executed, the copy object is updated:\ncopy_of_mNetworkRegistrationInfos#CellIdentity#mAlphaLong\ncopy_of_mNetworkRegistrationInfos#CellIdentity#mAlphaShort\n\nWhile the object under mNewSS is not updated: \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003e NG?\nmNewSS#mNetworkRegistrationInfos#CellIdentity#mAlphaLong\nmNewSS#mNetworkRegistrationInfos#CellIdentity#mAlphaShort\n\n\nCould you please check whether my understanding is correct?\nIf my understanding is wrong, please kindly help to correct me.\n\nIf my understanding is correct, maybe we should provide new interface to update ServiceState#mNetworkRegistrationInfos directly instead of the copy.\n\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003dplatform/frameworks/opt/telephony reference code start\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n\ndiff --git a/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/ServiceStateTracker.java b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/ServiceStateTracker.java\nindex aa1fc11c55..54136bfad4 100755\n--- a/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/ServiceStateTracker.java\n+++ b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/ServiceStateTracker.java\n@@ -5406,16 +5406,7 @@ public class ServiceStateTracker extends Handler {\n                 filterOperatorNameByPattern(servicestate.getOperatorAlphaLong()),\n                 filterOperatorNameByPattern(servicestate.getOperatorAlphaShort()),\n                 servicestate.getOperatorNumeric());\n-\n-        List\u00