ationInfos) {\n+                updateOperatorNameForCellIdentity(operatorNameStrPattern, nri.getCellIdentity());\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private void updateOperatorNameForCellIdentity(@NonNull Pattern operatorNameStrPattern,\n+            @Nullable CellIdentity cellIdentity) {\n+        if (cellIdentity \u003d\u003d null) {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+        cellIdentity.setOperatorAlphaLong(\n+                filterOperatorNameByPattern(operatorNameStrPattern,\n+                        (String) cellIdentity.getOperatorAlphaLong()));\n+        cellIdentity.setOperatorAlphaShort(\n+                filterOperatorNameByPattern(operatorNameStrPattern,\n+                        (String) cellIdentity.getOperatorAlphaShort()));\n+    }\n+\n+    private String filterOperatorNameByPattern(@NonNull Pattern operatorNameStrPattern,\n+            String operatorName) {\n+        if (operatorNameStrPattern \u003d\u003d null || TextUtils.isEmpty(operatorName)) {\n+            return operatorName;\n+        }\n+        Matcher matcher \u003d operatorNameStrPattern.matcher(operatorName);\n+        if (matcher.find()) {\n+            if (matcher.groupCount() \u003e 0) {\n+                operatorName \u003d matcher.group(1);\n+            } else {\n+                if (DBG) Rlog.e(LOG_TAG, \"filterOperatorNameByPattern: pattern no group\");\n+            }\n+        }\n+        return operatorName;\n+    }\n }\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003dplatform/frameworks/base reference code end\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n\nThanks",
